{
  "uid": "conta-bff",
  "title": "Conta Digital: BFF",
  "description": "BFF (Fase 2): SLI da home, RED por rota, degradação parcial, dependência do ledger, recursos do Node, logs e traces. Provisionado como código: edite o JSON, não a interface. Fase 3: dependências incluem o transfers (Pix e limites da home).",
  "tags": [
    "conta-digital",
    "bff",
    "fase-2"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Abrir a home (SLI da seção 7.3 do plano)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "SLI: GET /home sem 5xx e abaixo de 250 ms",
      "description": "SLO: 99,5% das aberturas sem 5xx e em até 300 ms. O histograma não tem fronteira em 300 ms; a mais próxima por baixo é 250 ms, então o valor é conservador. Janela de 5 min.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"bff\",http_route=\"/home\",http_response_status_code!~\"5..\",le=\"0.25\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"bff\",http_route=\"/home\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 99
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99.5
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "sem tráfego"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Home degradada (% das respostas 200)",
      "description": "Respostas 200 com o extrato indisponível. Degradar é o comportamento de proteção (ADR-0005), mas uma fração alta significa extrato lento ou fora do ar.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(bff_home_degraded_total{job=\"bff\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"bff\",http_route=\"/home\",http_response_status_code=\"200\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "sem tráfego"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Home por status HTTP",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"bff\",http_route=\"/home\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_response_status_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "200 = abriu (inclusive degradada); 401 = token inválido ou conta do token inexistente (o front volta ao login); 503, 504 e 502 = o saldo (essencial) falhou."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "HTTP (RED)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Taxa por rota",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"bff\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Erros 5xx (% das requisições por rota)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"bff\",http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{job=\"bff\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência p50, p95 e p99 por rota",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"bff\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{http_route}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"bff\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{http_route}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"bff\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 {{http_route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Degradação parcial",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Respostas degradadas por seção e motivo",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (home_section, home_degraded_reason) (rate(bff_home_degraded_total{job=\"bff\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{home_section}}: {{home_degraded_reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Contador bff.home.degraded. Motivos: timeout, unavailable, error. O mesmo evento marca o span GET /home com home.degraded=true (painel de traces abaixo)."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Timeouts das dependências vistos pelo BFF (DEADLINE_EXCEEDED)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 15
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (dependency, rpc_method) (rate(rpc_client_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"bff\",dependency=~\"ledger|transfers\",rpc_response_status_code=\"DEADLINE_EXCEEDED\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Prazos: saldo 250 ms, extrato 200 ms (LEDGER_BALANCE_TIMEOUT_MS, LEDGER_STATEMENT_TIMEOUT_MS)."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Dependências: ledger e transfers (cliente gRPC)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Chamadas por método e status",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (rpc_method, rpc_response_status_code) (rate(rpc_client_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"bff\",dependency=~\"ledger|transfers\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}} {{rpc_response_status_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Falhas (% das chamadas por método)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum by (dependency, rpc_method) (rate(rpc_client_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"bff\",dependency=~\"ledger|transfers\",rpc_response_status_code!=\"OK\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (dependency, rpc_method) (rate(rpc_client_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"bff\",dependency=~\"ledger|transfers\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Todo status diferente de OK, inclusive NOT_FOUND (CPF sem conta no login)."
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latência p99 por método",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, dependency, rpc_method) (rate(rpc_client_call_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"bff\",dependency=~\"ledger|transfers\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Recursos (USE)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Atraso do event loop (p99)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "nodejs_eventloop_delay_p99_seconds{job=\"bff\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Saturação do Node: cresce quando algo bloqueia o laço principal. Base do load shedding da Fase 6."
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Heap em uso",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 33
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "nodejs_heap_used_bytes{job=\"bff\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Logs e traces",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs do BFF",
      "description": "Um log por requisição, com trace_id (vira link para o trace no Tempo) e account_id; nunca CPF nem token.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 42
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_name=\"bff\"}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Traces de home degradada",
      "description": "GET /home com home.degraded=true: o span do cliente que estourou o prazo está em vermelho dentro do trace.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 42
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"bff\" && span.home.degraded = true }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
